{"id":"recientemente","lemma":"recientemente","pos":"adv","rank":1862,"glosses":["recently"],"ipa":"/reˌθjenteˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-recientemente.wav","examples":[{"text":"He estado holgazaneando recientemente.","en":"I've been sluggish recently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803951"},{"text":"He estado muy ocupado recientemente.","en":"I've been so busy recently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582630"},{"text":"¿A quién has ayudado recientemente?","en":"Who have you helped recently?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/551309"},{"text":"Recientemente hemos tenido varios siniestros.","en":"Recently we have had several disasters.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/806281"},{"text":"Él ha fundado una empresa recientemente.","en":"He set up a company recently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/706923"}]}